(Solvofin is an AI-powered mobile urban intelligence and computer vision platform conceived, architected, and built to solve) Tj
T* (critical urban mobility, transit asset degradation, and commuter safety challenges. In high-density municipalities such as) Tj
T* (Greater Visakhapatnam Municipal Corporation \(GVMC\) and transit authorities globally, urban road networks and public transit) Tj
T* (fleets operate under severe operational strain. Road surfaces develop cavities, alligator cracking, and edge deterioration that) Tj
T* (jeopardize commuter safety; public transit bus interiors face neglected stanchion and seating damage; transit operators) Tj
T* (experience unmonitored cognitive fatigue; and traffic bottlenecks compound vehicular emissions.) Tj
