T* (Retrieval-Augmented Generation \(RAG\) grounded in national civil engineering standards, and multi-role municipal decision) Tj
T* (support. Rather than relying on static dashboards, Solvofin transforms unstructured video frames into structured, geolocated) Tj
T* (defect records, correlates transit telemetry with regulatory codes \(such as IRC:82-2015\), and generates prioritized work orders) Tj
T* (under strict human-in-the-loop oversight.) Tj
