T* (coaching and break-recommendation tool.) Tj
T* (4. NO LEGAL LIABILITY: Visual vigilance signals do not assign legal or civil fault for traffic collisions or incidents.) Tj
T* (5. CAUSE AMBIGUITY: Underlying physiological or psychological causes cannot be determined from visual signals alone.) Tj
