0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
45.354330708661422 666.3142125984252289 Td
(1. Weather & Optical Occlusion: Heavy monsoon rainfall, waterlogging, or severe lens glare can obscure camera visibility,) Tj
T* (reducing pavement defect detection accuracy.) Tj
T* (2. Surface Depth Estimation: Optical 2D cameras estimate pothole depth using shadow geometry and perspective cues.) Tj
T* (Accurate volumetric measurement requires specialized 3D LiDAR or laser profilometers.) Tj
T* (3. Subsurface Blindspots: Optical computer vision detects surface distress only. Internal subgrade moisture, soil compaction) Tj
T* (voids, and base structural instability cannot be diagnosed from surface imagery alone.) Tj
T* (4. Human Review Latency: While AI defect extraction takes seconds, final municipal action depends on human supervisor) Tj
T* (review velocity and contractor dispatch schedules.) Tj
T* (5. Academic Research Scope: The system has been validated in controlled development environments and simulated urban) Tj
T* (scenarios; field deployment requires municipal hardware certification.) Tj
