(Future development pathways for the Solvofin research initiative include:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
45.354330708661422 477.2433464566929047 Td
(• Longitudinal Degradation Modeling: Training time-series forecasting models to predict pavement cavity growth rates based on) Tj
T* (traffic density and monsoon weather forecasts.) Tj
T* (• Mobile LiDAR Sensor Fusion: Integrating smartphone LiDAR sensors \(ToF\) on field survey units to capture) Tj
T* (millimeter-accurate 3D point cloud meshes of road cavities.) Tj
T* (• V2X Transit Warning Network: Establishing Vehicle-to-Everything \(V2X\) low-latency mesh networks to broadcast high-severity) Tj
T* (pothole warnings directly to trailing vehicles.) Tj
T* (• Multi-Lingual Citizen Accessibility: Expanding the Citizen Portal with natural-language voice reporting in regional Indian) Tj
T* (languages \(Telugu, Hindi\) for universal civic inclusion.) Tj
